  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "The All Seasons Collection 30A proudly presents this \"Spectacular Vacation Getaway,\" an exquisite addition to our portfolio of distinctive homes nestled in the town of Rosemary Beach.<br><br>Designed with coastal elegance in mind, this meticulously maintained home offers an open and airy atmosphere, ideal for creating cherished moments with family and friends. The first-floor living area exudes comfort, featuring plush seating, a modern, state-of-the-art kitchen, and a chic dining space reminiscent of Restoration Hardware's signature style. Every detail has been thoughtfully curated, from the Venetian plaster walls to the floor-to-ceiling windows and French doors that open to a serene outdoor courtyard. This inviting space includes a dining and lounge area, a natural gas grill, an outdoor shower, and a spacious pool with cascading water features (pool heating available for $400 per week). A cozy king bedroom with an adjoining bathroom is also conveniently located on this floor.<br><br>On the second floor, you'll find a welcoming lounge area with a 55\" TV, perfect for relaxing. This level boasts a luxurious King Master Suite with a spacious walk-in closet. The master ensuite features dual vanities, a large walk-in shower, and a stunning European soaking tub. Additionally, this floor includes a queen bedroom and a charming bunk room with four beds. These two bedrooms share a beautifully designed bathroom with a walk-in shower. A larger laundryroom is also located on this floor.<br><br>The third floor offers additional sleeping for the younger crowd 6 bunk style beds and an accompanying bathroom with a combination tub/shower. Every bedroom in the home is equipped with a TV for added convenience and entertainment.<br>Parking is a plus with two designated parking spaces<br><br>Create lasting memories in this exceptional home while enjoying the charm and beauty of Rosemary Beach.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
